   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 108 of the laws of 2016, amending the vehicle and\ntraffic law relating to authorizing a pilot residential parking permit system\nin the city of Buffalo, in relation to permanently authorizing such provisions",
    "basePrintNo": "S9492",
